    "lookup_name": "WaveFunctions_3D_Wave_Propagation_p1",
    "description": "A wave is not an object\u2014it's a disturbance traveling through a medium. Watch waves emanate from sources, diminishing by inverse square law. Learn distance fields, phase propagation (sin(time - dist)), attenuation, and interference. Discover that identity is permeable: you are not a static entity, but a point of intersection for the world's noise.",
